// PROJECTION, D5: decorative-animation with a VIBE that declares SURFACE_AS visual.
// Rule 112 on the row "perceive". No fixture declared the visual medium before this one,
// although 94 of the 122 rules are written for it. Visual carries every verb, so nothing about
// the medium should change the verdict: this fixture proves it does not.
//
// Expected: DECORATIVE_ANIMATION

DEFINE VIBE screen_surface (
  SURFACE_AS visual
)

DEFINE FEEDBACK saved_pulse (
  TONE celebratory
)
